testdata/err/280_print_unsupported_type.aic:8:25: error: this class has no init constructor
    Box(...)
    fix: a class without init uses a composite literal: Box{field: value} (core design §4)
testdata/err/280_print_unsupported_type.aic:9:18: error: printing a class needs @derive(ToString)
    type err.Box has no ToString
    fix: annotate the class with @derive(ToString), or print its fields individually (core design §14)
